Cell["\<\
Based on ref. (1), the daily nutrition energy of 6,100 (\[Venus]\:fe0e) or \
6,800 (\[Mars]\:fe0e)\[NonBreakingSpace]kJ/day requires a daily turnover of \
60\[NonBreakingSpace]kg of ATP: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964591350660942*^9, 3.964591389973628*^9}, {
  3.964591438299749*^9, 3.964591588151208*^9}, {3.9645917764640007`*^9, 
  3.964591782274181*^9}, {3.984707289216691*^9, 3.9847072900241623`*^9}},
